Z||000000||saleenfiero||03-01-2001||01:17 PM||||I found a set of chromed rims off of a 98 or so Camaro.  You know the style, basic Camaro sort of directional 5-spoke deals.  With 235 55-16's on them.  Any chance these might fit on the little plastic fantastics?<P>------------------<BR>'86 SE - My car is actually a MacLaren F1 with a Fiero body kit; or not.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Tigger||03-01-2001||01:24 PM||||No.  Fieros are 5 lug on 100mm pattern.  I'm about 99% certain camaro's are different.<P>You would have to change the hub pattern to make them work but even then I'm not sure if the offset would be right.<P>Those are nice wheels tho.<p>[This message has been edited by Tigger (edited 03-01-2001).]||||reg||1
