Z||000004||Will||03-01-2001||02:22 PM||||If they have an appropriate offset, you would be able to put them on the back if you went to Pontiac 6000 hub carriers, hubs, brakes, and outer CV joints in the rear. You might have some proportioning valve issues, however. But those are pretty easy to fix the right spring.||||reg||1
